  "description": "is a component within the Ahura framework, designed to provide comprehensive identity and authentication management services. It offers tools for handling user authentication, authorization, and role-based access control, integrating seamlessly with ASP.NET Core Identity. This extension simplifies common identity-related tasks, such as user registration, login, password management, and role assignments. It also supports token-based authentication, allowing for secure, scalable user identity management across applications. The service is intended to be easily customizable, providing a flexible identity solution suitable for various application needs.",
